mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.289em; margin-left: 0.051em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>9</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><msqrt><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><msqrt><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, notice that the expression inside the radical is a perfect square. So, we can continue simplifying by writing the expression as this perfect square:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"38\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 4.69em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></